# GludioHold's no-desire and move-finished hooks on a knight (35235): standing off its post,
# out of the character's sight, with nothing to do, it wants to walk back to its spawn point
# with weight 30 (an NPC first idles on its second cycle), and walks there on the cycle
# after; arriving, it wants to do nothing for 40 with weight 30.
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioHold
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioKnight
npc knight 35235 SiegeGuard 700 0 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300

jump knight 800 0 0
  at knight 800 0 0
  desires knight -

tick x2
  desires knight move_to(700,0,0)=30

tick
walk knight
  at knight 700 0 0
  desires knight nothing(40)=30
